<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dell Computer cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dell Computer cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns downgraded Dell Computer Corp to attractive from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Dell closed Friday at 163.</p>
</text>
